      "side": 1,
      "message": "LGTM. ANGLE does the same thing in D3D11, we cache everything that the API creates, even if it claims to cache internally. That includes things like BlendState, DepthStencilState, RasterizerState.",
      "revId": "29209acedce8d3e805fabb39b6fe3e51c0da11be",
